  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day possessive retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <p>Come back tomorrow. Read the relationship first, then choose the word before the noun.</p>

    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. Your points to the listener, its points to one app, and singular their points to one caller whose gender is not known.">
      <h3>Choose from memory</h3>
      <p class="choice-hint">Tap each gap, then choose the possessive word</p>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Answer choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="my">my</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="your">your</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="its">its</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="our">our</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="their">their</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>I am speaking directly to you: “What is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="your" data-hint="The question is for the listener, so use the you → your pair." data-fix="your name" data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> name?”</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The app has a new icon. This is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="its" data-hint="One app is an it, and a noun follows the gap." data-fix="its new icon" data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> new icon.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>A caller left a number, but I do not know the caller’s gender. This is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="their" data-hint="Use the they → their pair for one person whose gender is not known." data-fix="their number" data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> number.</span></div>
